    name: "Chin Yoke Mee",
    rating: 5,
    comment:
      "Great customer support, professional delivery team, reliable safe & reasonable prices. Strongly recommended!",
    avatarSrc: "/ornis/reviews/chin-yoke-mee.png",
  },
  {
    name: "Cheng Lim",
    rating: 5,
    comment: "Sales person very good service & patience. High recommed their safe, good quality, nice product.",
